Project Title

Predictive Analytics and Forecasting Using Historical Data

Objective

Develop a predictive analytics solution that uses historical data to forecast future trends, enabling organizations to make proactive, data-driven decisions.

The project focuses on:

Data cleaning and preprocessing
Exploratory data analysis
Predictive modeling using Regression and Time-Series techniques
Model evaluation and accuracy measurement
Forecast visualization
Problem Statement

Organizations collect large volumes of historical data but often struggle to predict future outcomes. Predictive analytics helps identify patterns and estimate future trends such as:

Sales Forecasting
Revenue Prediction
Demand Forecasting
Customer Growth Prediction
Inventory Planning
